Cryptomator is a trademark of Skymatic GmbH.

This product includes:

- src/encryptor_mcp/vault/words_en.txt: the 4096-word list Cryptomator uses for recovery keys, from the Cryptomator
  desktop app (https://github.com/cryptomator/cryptomator), licensed GPL-3.0. Included so that recovery keys are
  the same in Encryptor MCP and in Cryptomator.

The compatibility tests use the cryptofs and cryptolib libraries (AGPL-3.0), which they fetch from
Maven Central or read from an installed Cryptomator.app; those libraries are not part of this package.
